    "name": "Fossil Diggers VR",
    "steam_appid": 975630,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/09c2a239b27aee5ed4fc138716cb794d.poster.avif?t=1692946126\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/09c2a239b27aee5ed4fc138716cb794d.webm?t=1692946126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/09c2a239b27aee5ed4fc138716cb794d.mp4?t=1692946126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In an alternate world, giant fossils are being unearthed across the globe. You\u2019re recruited by renegade scientist Dr Peggy Noon to help prove her outlandish theory that \u201cdinosaurs\u201d once existed.<br><br>Travel to uncharted locations, dig up fossils and piece them together to prove that dinosaurs once roamed the earth. Your search takes a dangerous turn when you uncover the mysterious Particle 58, and when Peggy goes missing it is up to you to reveal the truth behind the lie: that these magnificent creatures hold the key to understanding our past\u2014and a warning for our future.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore Environments</h2>Climb, rappel, chop vines, break-apart rocks, and solve puzzles to find fossils.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/fb072448a645b4ae1c72393c4732b01b.poster.avif?t=1692946126\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/fb072448a645b4ae1c72393c4732b01b.webm?t=1692946126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/fb072448a645b4ae1c72393c4732b01b.mp4?t=1692946126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Uncover Fossils</h2>Use your pickaxe to break open digsites, then throw your drop bin to teleport fossils back to your tent.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/802b39da6df151168e344d73af9ab254.poster.avif?t=1692946126\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/802b39da6df151168e344d73af9ab254.webm?t=1692946126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/802b39da6df151168e344d73af9ab254.mp4?t=1692946126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build Dinosaurs</h2>Like a three-dimensional jigsaw puzzle, piece the dinosaur together and watch it come alive before your eyes.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/09c2a239b27aee5ed4fc138716cb794d.poster.avif?t=1692946126\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/09c2a239b27aee5ed4fc138716cb794d.webm?t=1692946126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/09c2a239b27aee5ed4fc138716cb794d.mp4?t=1692946126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bring Dinosaurs To Life</h2>Place the final fossil and watch dinosaurs come alive in front of your eyes.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/be2ed7911e358d42bbe0f903c6658719.poster.avif?t=1692946126\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/be2ed7911e358d42bbe0f903c6658719.webm?t=1692946126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/be2ed7911e358d42bbe0f903c6658719.mp4?t=1692946126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Watch the Environment Change</h2>Watch the environment move from chaos to serenity as you complete the dinosaur.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/4a5d55e406a747cc5d5309cc33e56ad9.poster.avif?t=1692946126\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/4a5d55e406a747cc5d5309cc33e56ad9.webm?t=1692946126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/09c2a239b27aee5ed4fc138716cb794d.poster.avif?t=1692946126\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/09c2a239b27aee5ed4fc138716cb794d.webm?t=1692946126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/09c2a239b27aee5ed4fc138716cb794d.mp4?t=1692946126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In an alternate world, giant fossils are being unearthed across the globe. You\u2019re recruited by renegade scientist Dr Peggy Noon to help prove her outlandish theory that \u201cdinosaurs\u201d once existed.<br><br>Travel to uncharted locations, dig up fossils and piece them together to prove that dinosaurs once roamed the earth. Your search takes a dangerous turn when you uncover the mysterious Particle 58, and when Peggy goes missing it is up to you to reveal the truth behind the lie: that these magnificent creatures hold the key to understanding our past\u2014and a warning for our future.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore Environments</h2>Climb, rappel, chop vines, break-apart rocks, and solve puzzles to find fossils.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/fb072448a645b4ae1c72393c4732b01b.poster.avif?t=1692946126\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/fb072448a645b4ae1c72393c4732b01b.webm?t=1692946126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/fb072448a645b4ae1c72393c4732b01b.mp4?t=1692946126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Uncover Fossils</h2>Use your pickaxe to break open digsites, then throw your drop bin to teleport fossils back to your tent.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/802b39da6df151168e344d73af9ab254.poster.avif?t=1692946126\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/802b39da6df151168e344d73af9ab254.webm?t=1692946126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/802b39da6df151168e344d73af9ab254.mp4?t=1692946126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build Dinosaurs</h2>Like a three-dimensional jigsaw puzzle, piece the dinosaur together and watch it come alive before your eyes.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/09c2a239b27aee5ed4fc138716cb794d.poster.avif?t=1692946126\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/09c2a239b27aee5ed4fc138716cb794d.webm?t=1692946126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/09c2a239b27aee5ed4fc138716cb794d.mp4?t=1692946126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bring Dinosaurs To Life</h2>Place the final fossil and watch dinosaurs come alive in front of your eyes.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/be2ed7911e358d42bbe0f903c6658719.poster.avif?t=1692946126\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/be2ed7911e358d42bbe0f903c6658719.webm?t=1692946126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/be2ed7911e358d42bbe0f903c6658719.mp4?t=1692946126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Watch the Environment Change</h2>Watch the environment move from chaos to serenity as you complete the dinosaur.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/4a5d55e406a747cc5d5309cc33e56ad9.poster.avif?t=1692946126\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975630/extras/4a5d55e406a747cc5d5309cc33e56ad9.webm?t=1692946126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
